--- !u!114 &1884308532
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1884308531}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 662bbd4249abe3140ba2c86ce9b24e91, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestManager
  questItems:
  - itemId: Keyboard
    displayName: Keyboard
    memoryLine: I remember the first line of code ever typed on this floor. It was in Python. It didn't compile. We were all very proud anyway.
    hintLine: Follow the sound of keys being typed on. Look for the oldest one in the lounge.
  - itemId: Plaque
    displayName: Plaque
    memoryLine: This plaque marks `[the floor's opening / a founder / an award]`. I remember the day it went up. There was `[free food / a speech / a very long speech]`.
    hintLine: "It\u2019s mounted and it\u2019s shiny. Look near the entrance."
  - itemId: VCDArtwork
    displayName: VCD Artwork
    memoryLine: The VCD students made this and hung it on our floor. We write code, they make art. This floor is better because we share it.
    hintLine: Something made by our neighbours in Visual Communication Design.
  - itemId: CollabWall
    displayName: Collab Wall
    memoryLine: Every logo on this wall is a door someone opened. These companies worked with our students, and some of them hired us after.
    hintLine: A wooden wall covered in names.
  - itemId: Forgy
    displayName: Forgy
    memoryLine: Forgy and I go way back. It's the face of Informatics, I'm the keeper of this floor. Between us, we've seen every new batch walk in.
    hintLine: Look for a friend of mine. Another mascot.
  allowMemoryReplay: 1
  logScans: 1
